/v/t64.5771-25/38974504_999332164037048_8352848161181583365_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=la4QvWfTxAkQ7kNvwElvGH9&_nc_oc=AdpkMYkNDSbNucoJmMTI2_lQZVrhuEDnMkROUZtBchcQlwz-y9fFTPZgOpVwV6pSEXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7aRHfu4u8ONNeit54_Jdfgb30kn4kXmDgdkyd_r28Dw&oe=6AAFF4F9"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom2.png", "id": "1060903411489141", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031501_1060903414822474_9192607785681237416_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sqxEl96q16AQ7kNvwHt157k&_nc_oc=Adq6uhmGAuJAJMOhpP702EhBoekC5hsLLOpK7EjHbNRCdfdnBSjm3zKvr8Eb9M2pYDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKes3exrQSfPjoiniD0VkDTEUWfmdyuheH32Xoc1YLxvQ&oe=6AB00683"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom3.png", "id": "1333559243720099", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1333559247053432_5526570972152141129_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IaVg6K2CSn4Q7kNvwGD3jKI&_nc_oc=AdqDPcwlsXwOS9SIAjd28cLIyl6I9rrs6ALufsUSJQRfbiPexNpKourwxlTiAotuidc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ1cRZ2O_Z9n1BItoW8ghTv79sE5YDwNnkwkFrUGUxs6Q&oe=6AAFFD4E"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom4.png", "id": "403819987828479", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_403819991161812_8720327022213224385_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a31eb2Uke4AQ7kNvwFMWuYx&_nc_oc=AdrpKd2tI6q5pllGBUWU4MeI7udqRWCaQlg2A1gzYEu1gwrHzMkhDR9cM9UNBJaK7GA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJjk_p-0n-RE1hThr2E3kg-PIskoaEluH_vGcjsaWnUmg&oe=6AB00573"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_vPj4YhbfakQ7kNvwGMMx5K&_nc_oc=AdozVUpjml2HT_KBwC56x4e7C9otqK5Ho8BMZhHxlrSmcRo-h3M9hZ9Mp5Z7q3MPVak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJFuvw_06bXecX-uSevXJfLjaegwzq7RjYsNuITyJ_iHw&oe=6AAFFEBB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_name": "SQLearn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sqlearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The consortium of the VR-ME project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-me.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating":